Patch Precedent
===============

This project includes references to and short excerpts of relatedb/relate
(https://github.com/relatedb/relate), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, at commit 5f7a510713c3feac146133e77d8c5bb72bae1b11:

- Decision text from ADR-0585 (docs/adr/0585-installer-downloads-via-direct-route.md),
  paraphrased in evidence/installer.toml.
- Line references and check descriptions from scripts/tests/test_install_sh.sh.
- Diff context from distribution/install.sh, appearing in the patches under
  fixtures/installer/.
- The subject line of the implementing commit
  5ac38808547d11f55b02333624cc3e88b46566eb, quoted in evidence/installer.toml.
- Check descriptions and line references from scripts/tests/test_release_advance.sh,
  in evidence/release.toml and in the TAP captures under tests/data/release/.
- The subject line of the implementing commit
  d79d8b150561f56b4940876a067d6b7e4781d2bc, quoted in evidence/release.toml.
- ADR titles and statuses for all decisions, quoted in
  evidence/scanned/decisions.tsv.
- File paths and line numbers of ADR citations, recorded in
  evidence/scanned/citations.tsv.
- Decision text from ADR-0580 (docs/adr/0580-post-release-workspace-versioning.md),
  paraphrased in evidence/release.toml, plus the release fixtures' diff context
  from scripts/release-bump.sh and CONTRIBUTING.md, appearing in the patches
  under fixtures/release/.

The patches in fixtures/installer/ and fixtures/release/ are authored
demonstration inputs written against Relate's code. They are not upstream
changes.

The upstream repository is fetched at run time into a local cache and is not
vendored in this repository.

